message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Goyal"
    given-names: "Naman"
title: "SMVac-Research: Numerical Study of Standard Model Electroweak Vacuum Stability"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
url: "https://github.com/namangoyal31/SMVac-Research"
description: "Semi-analytical computation of the Standard Model electroweak vacuum decay action via 3-loop RG running, the RG-improved 1-loop effective potential, and the Fubini-Lipatov conformal profile, with validation tests and a stability phase diagram in the Higgs-top mass plane."
repository-code: "https://github.com/namangoyal31/SMVac-Research"
keywords:
  - Standard Model
  - vacuum stability
  - bounce action
  - Fubini-Lipatov
  - electroweak
